            <ArticleTitle>Assessment of a patient with an acute exacerbation of asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article is a reflective account of the respiratory assessment of a patient experiencing an acute exacerbation of asthma in hospital. The patient's signs and symptoms are examined and an analysis of the respiratory assessment and the patient's treatment is provided.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
